    <bpmn:process id="W_W4690" name="W4690. Insider-Threat Detection, Background Re-Check &amp; Offboarding Risk" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Insider-threat indicator; role change (to sensitive role); offboarding (VS-19)
Frequency: Continuous + per indicator
Volume: ~ indicators across ~6,918 employees + contingent (VS-98) + sensitive-role population
Owner: CSO / Insider-Threat Program Manager
Participants: HR (VS-19/VS-103), IT/cyber (VS-27.3 — user-behavior analytics), Ethics (VS-119), Legal (VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W4690 — Insider-Threat Detection, Background Re-Check &amp; Offboarding Risk</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4690_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4690_Lane1" name="Insider-Threat Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4690_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4690_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4690_Lane2" name="CSO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4690_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4690_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4690_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4690_Start4" name="Insider-threat indicator; role change (to sensitive role); offboarding (VS-19)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4690_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4690_Task5" name="Operate insider-threat detection: indicators from HR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Operate insider-threat detection: indicators from HR (performance/behavior/financial-stress VS-103), cyber (data-exfiltration/user-behavior analytics VS-27.3), ethics (VS-119), and access patterns; assess for espionage, sabotage, fraud, or workplace-violence potential
Responsible (R): Insider-Threat Program Manager / CSO
Accountable (A): CSO / VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4690_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4690_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4690_Task6" name="Conduct background re-checks for sensitive roles (finance, treasury VS-18…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Conduct background re-checks for sensitive roles (finance, treasury VS-18, data/privacy, security, executive support) and on indicators; manage offboarding-risk (W43 separation) — access revocation, exit interviews, data-handling review
Responsible (R): CSO / HR / IT Security
Accountable (A): CSO / CHRO
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4690_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4690_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4690_Task7" name="Intervene proportionately (support, monitoring, role change, discipline…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Intervene proportionately (support, monitoring, role change, discipline, law-enforcement referral) with Legal/HR/privacy safeguards (VS-91/VS-84); document and review
Responsible (R): CSO / Legal / HR
Accountable (A): CSO / VP Legal
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4690_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4690_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4690_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4690_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4690_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-709 (ensure controlled execution — Investigations, Insider Threat, Workplace Violence &amp; Crisis Response (PA-159.3).) | - CTL-709: monitoring lawful and proportionate (VS-91/VS-84); sensitive-role re-checks; offboarding access revoked
Owner: CSO / Insider-Threat Program Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4690_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4690_Annotation9" targetRef="W4690_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4690_Flow11" sourceRef="W4690_Start4" targetRef="W4690_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4690_Flow12" sourceRef="W4690_Task5" targetRef="W4690_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4690_Flow13" sourceRef="W4690_Task6" targetRef="W4690_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4690_Flow14" sourceRef="W4690_Task7" targetRef="W4690_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
