    <bpmn:process id="W_W4692" name="W4692. Active-Assailant, Civil-Unrest &amp; Protest / Crowd Response Protocol" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Active-assailant/armed-attack; civil unrest; protest/riot at or near a site/event
Frequency: Rare (preparedness continuous)
Volume: ~ hopefully rare; 1 rehearsed protocol per site type
Owner: CSO / GSOC Manager
Participants: Store/DC ops (VS-07/VS-04), Facilities (VS-138), HR (VS-19), law enforcement (PNP), comms (VS-14.3), BCP (VS-26)
Source: workflow W4692 — Active-Assailant, Civil-Unrest &amp; Protest / Crowd Response Protocol</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4692_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4692_Lane1" name="GSOC">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4692_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4692_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4692_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4692_Lane2" name="CSO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4692_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4692_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4692_Start4" name="Active-assailant/armed-attack; civil unrest; protest/riot at or near a site/event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4692_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4692_Task5" name="Maintain and rehearse active-assailant/civil-unrest response protocols…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain and rehearse active-assailant/civil-unrest response protocols (run-hide-fight, lockdown, evacuation, shelter-in-place) for HQ, stores, DCs, and events; train staff and integrate with BCP (VS-26) and fire-drill programs
Responsible (R): GSOC / CSO / Facilities
Accountable (A): CSO / COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4692_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4692_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4692_Task6" name="On incident: activate the protocol, alert law enforcement (W4693), execute…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: On incident: activate the protocol, alert law enforcement (W4693), execute lockdown/evacuation per the situation, account for people, and coordinate medical (VS-83) and crisis comms (VS-14.3)
Responsible (R): GSOC / Site Mgmt / CSO
Accountable (A): CSO / COO
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4692_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4692_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4692_Task7" name="Conduct post-incident review and trauma support (VS-83 EAP); coordinate with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Conduct post-incident review and trauma support (VS-83 EAP); coordinate with BCP (VS-26) for business resumption and with Legal/insurance (VS-100/VS-26) for liability
Responsible (R): CSO / HR / Legal / Insurance
Accountable (A): CSO / COO
Duration: Post-incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4692_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4692_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4692_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4692_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
