    <bpmn:process id="W_W4693" name="W4693. Surveillance, Evidence Collection &amp; Coordination with Law Enforcement (PNP/NBI)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Investigation (W4689); incident (W4694); prosecution
Frequency: Per case/incident
Volume: ~ per significant case/incident
Owner: CSO / Corporate Investigations Manager
Participants: Legal (VS-100.3), Privacy (VS-91), law enforcement (PNP/NBI/PNP-ACG), prosecutors, digital forensics (VS-27.3)
Source: workflow W4693 — Surveillance, Evidence Collection &amp; Coordination with Law Enforcement (PNP/NBI)</bpmn:documentation>
