    <bpmn:process id="W_W4695" name="W4695. Executive &amp; Corporate Extortion, Defamation &amp; Coordinated-Attack Response" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Extortion attempt; smear/defamation campaign; coordinated attack (physical + reputational + cyber) on BuildRight or a principal
Frequency: Rare (preparedness continuous)
Volume: ~ hopefully rare; 1 coordinated-response protocol
Owner: CSO / VP Legal (joint)
Participants: CEO, Comms/PR (VS-14.3), Legal (VS-100.3), Cyber (VS-27.3), Protective Intel (W4674), law enforcement, crisis comms firm
Source: workflow W4695 — Executive &amp; Corporate Extortion, Defamation &amp; Coordinated-Attack Response</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4695_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4695_Lane1" name="CSO">
