        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4695_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4695_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4695_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4695_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4695_Start3" name="Extortion attempt; smear/defamation campaign; coordinated attack (physical + reputational…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4695_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4695_Task4" name="Maintain the coordinated-attack/extortion/defamation response protocol…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the coordinated-attack/extortion/defamation response protocol: convergence of physical security, cyber, legal, and comms; law-enforcement engagement; and the no-concession posture where mandated by policy/law
Responsible (R): CSO / VP Legal
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Continuous readiness</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4695_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4695_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4695_Task5" name="On an extortion/defamation/coordinated-attack event: activate the response…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: On an extortion/defamation/coordinated-attack event: activate the response, assess credibility and intent (W4674), engage legal (cease-and-desist, prosecution VS-100) and crisis comms (VS-14.3), and coordinate with cyber (VS-27.3) for converged attacks
Responsible (R): CSO / VP Legal / Comms / Cyber
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4695_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4695_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4695_Task6" name="Manage to resolution; protect the principal/brand; conduct post-event review…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage to resolution; protect the principal/brand; conduct post-event review (W4696) and adjust intelligence, posture, and protocols
Responsible (R): CSO / VP Legal
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Post-event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4695_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4695_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4695_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4695_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4695_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-709 (ensure controlled execution — Investigations, Insider Threat, Workplace Violence &amp; Crisis Response (PA-159.3).) | - CTL-709: converged response protocol; Legal-guided; law-enforcement engagement; no-concession posture per policy
Owner: CSO / VP Legal (joint)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
